    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's very powerful. I really like how you framed it. To wrap this up, I want to finish the speech with a strong concluding statement. Could you write a final paragraph that essentially argues that any political viewpoint suggesting we scale back foreign aid is fundamentally regressive and incompatible with modern human rights values? I want to leave the audience with no doubt that supporting this aid is the only ethically defensible position.",
